{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t西營盤昨晚發生火警，一名男子送院後不治。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n消防處昨晚近9時接報，薄扶林道恆輝大廈發生火警，動用1條喉和1隊煙帽隊灌救，火勢大約一小時後大致救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n消防員在起火單位救出一名年約70歲的男子，昏迷送往瑪麗醫院搶救，其後證實不治。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n調查相信起火源頭是單位的廚房，懷疑是煮食引起，火警沒有可疑。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:39:07.875537+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:57:43.106595+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:37:49.862033+00:00","content_hash":"7ad01ae2ff1af38664ba0c871672795a211b90cccf3b7b2ace3bb0126b89287a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}